71,
"- 2026-10-11: On the Linux dev host `schema-check` (G4) reads kept homes only: a root test's home is removed when the test ends unless `AGENT_RUN_KEEP_HOMES=1` is set, so a chunk's `schema-check` gate entry reads the booted smoke home and whatever earlier homes stand, never the new cases' lines. A plan note must not say that entry validates them: the cases' own schema read and CI's G4 step do."
],
